	"web_text": "- From the Exotic to the Mystical: May 4, 2013 - August 4, 2013: Battles between the monarchy and other forms of sovereign government defined seventeenth-century England, and needleworkers responded with objects that reflected the social, ceremonial, and ritual aspects of court life. This highly decorative stumpwork picture celebrates the restoration of the monarchy, elevating the coronation of Charles II and his wife, Catherine of Braganza, to mythic proportions.",
